---
layout: default
title: Meet the Animals
---

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-farm-green">Meet the Animals</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-farm-brown-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Our farm family includes some of the friendliest creatures you'll ever meet.
      Come say hello — they love visitors.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
    <!-- Alpacas -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-farm-cream to-stone-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-4 border-white shadow-md">
        <span class="text-5xl">🦙</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-farm-green mb-3">Alpacas</h2>
      <p class="text-farm-brown-light leading-relaxed">
        Our gentle alpacas are the stars of the farm. With their soft fleece and curious
        personalities, they're always happy to pose for photos and accept treats.
        Kids and adults alike fall in love at first sight.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Goats -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-farm-cream to-stone-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-4 border-white shadow-md">
        <span class="text-5xl">🐐</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-farm-green mb-3">Goats</h2>
      <p class="text-farm-brown-light leading-relaxed">
        Our playful Nigerian dwarf goats are full of personality. Watch them climb,
        play, and compete for your attention. They're always up for a scratch
        behind the ears.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Ducks -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-farm-cream to-stone-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-4 border-white shadow-md">
        <span class="text-5xl">🦆</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-farm-green mb-3">Ducks</h2>
      <p class="text-farm-brown-light leading-relaxed">
        Our flock of friendly ducks waddles around the farm pond and pastures.
        Watch them splash and play, or try your hand at feeding time — they
        definitely won't be shy about it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Visit Info -->
<section class="bg-white border-t border-stone-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 text-center">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-farm-green mb-4">Visiting the Animals</h2>
    <p class="text-farm-brown-light text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
      Animal visits are available during regular farm hours. No appointment needed for
      day visits. For private animal encounters or group bookings, please get in touch.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:<%= site.metadata.email %>"
       class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-farm-green text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-farm-green-light transition-colors">
      Contact Us for Group Visits
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
